                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Article 21 of law No. 741 of December 26,
                    1900.</hi></head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Art</hi>. 21. For the second part of article 45 of
                    the law No. 641 of November 14, 1899, is substituted the following: “On the
                    labels of articles manufactured abroad, that are written wholly or partly in the
                    Portuguese language, the country of origin shall be indicated.”</p>
            </div>
